    {
        "text": "Lungmen, District 5- Inspection and Quarantine Zone",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "They're here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$radio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Attention, please...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Due to the Catastrophe's interference, all air traffic in Lungmen has been stopped. All entrances to District 5 will be closed in two hours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "We thank you for your cooperation during Oripathy inspections.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you discover any unregistered Infected, please inform a nearby peace officer immediately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "The L.G.D. will detain them in accordance with the 'Emergency Handling Act.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Attention, please...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$radio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just like the rumors said...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island was scheduled to meet with the L.G.D. at 10 o'clock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's 10:14 now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were late 14 minutes; therefore, you've wasted 14 minutes of my time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm sorry, Madam Ch'en, we just found out that Reunion is here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine, I already know. But that's not important right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who might this be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname} is Rhodes Island's consultant. Dr. Kal'tsit should already have informed you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, since everyone is here, I'll now need you to follow me to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en! It's an emergency! Those Infected... they're not...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 15,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't panic!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "First Squad, standby! Snipers, get into position!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-what's happening?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Civilian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let go of me! !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch... What's going on? Report the situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 15,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me go! ! Why are you arresting me? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "We didn't do anything wrong! ! !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Some Infected... are refusing to be taken in... We're...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can see that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Detain them all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Disperse the crowd immediately. Open the gates in 30 minutes after you finish the review process.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, push the quarantine inspection line forward 40 meters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Other than you and Dr. {@nickname}, the rest of Rhodes Island will stay here and assist with border security. The two of you, come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "If your group can't handle such a trivial task, I will not be able to assign you any missions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "PC94172, arrange some work for these people. I don't want to see any more trouble tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood, Madam!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, I'd like you to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Madam Ch'en is really tough... she's stricter than I imagined...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "... (Nod)",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "You two.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
