    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-what a tall building!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "S-sorry...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "... Rhodes Island is undoubtedly capable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for your praise, Madam.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "However...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "After the Chernobog incident, there's been a massive surge of refugees into Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected should already know what the consequences of entering Lungmen are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
